muew-preset 2
name Sub Bass
category Bass
author MUEW Factory
tags sub clean dry dark
desc Pure sine sub. Almost no harmonics, so it works under any other bass.
osc1Shape 0
osc2Shape 0
osc2Detune -12
osc2Level 0.4
filterCutoff 400
filterReso 0.2
filterMode 0
amp 0.005 0.1 1 0.1
mod 0.01 0.3 0 0.2
lfo1Rate 5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 2 0
warp2 6 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
routes 6
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
